OL,3,GNEWSAFootball match stopped over
OL,4,Aalleged homophobic abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA non-league football match was
OL,7,Fabandoned due to an alleged incident of
OL,8,Fhomophobic language directed at a
OL,9,Fplayer.
OL,11,FThe United Counties League Premier
OL,12,FDivision North game between Skegness
OL,13,FTown and Derbyshire side Clay Cross
OL,14,FTown, was stopped in the 80th minute on
OL,15,FSaturday with the Lincolnshire side
OL,16,Fwinning 3-2.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
